---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="How DeskKaki handles personal data under Singapore's PDPA."><article>
<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p class="muted">Last updated 28 October 2026</p>
<p>DeskKaki respects your privacy and aims to handle personal data in line with Singapore's Personal Data Protection Act 2012 (PDPA).</p>
<h2>What we collect</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Information you send us.</strong> If you email us, we receive your email address and whatever you include in your message. We use it only to reply to you.</li>
<li><strong>Analytics.</strong> We use privacy-friendly analytics (such as Cloudflare Web Analytics) to count page views and understand which guides are useful. This is aggregated data; we do not use it to identify you. If we ever add analytics that sets cookies (for example Google Analytics), we will update this page and ask for consent where required.</li>
<li><strong>Affiliate links.</strong> When you click a link to a retailer or affiliate network (for example Shopee, Lazada or Amazon), that site may set its own cookies to track the referral. Their privacy policies apply once you leave DeskKaki.</li></ul>
<h2>Cookies</h2>
<p>DeskKaki itself does not set advertising cookies. You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings; the site will still work.</p>
<h2>How we use and protect data</h2>
<p>We use personal data only for the purpose you gave it to us, don't sell it, and keep it only as long as needed. We take reasonable security measures to protect it.</p>
<h2>Your rights</h2>
<p>Under the PDPA you may ask to access or correct personal data we hold about you, or withdraw consent for its use. Contact our Data Protection Officer at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a> and we will respond within a reasonable time.</p>
</article></Base>
